---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';
---

<section
    class="section section--tint"
    aria-labelledby="home-pillars-title"
>
    <div class="shell">
        <SectionHead
            eyebrow="The experience"
            headingId="home-pillars-title"
        >
            What is Empow<span class="home-pillars__her">HER</span>?
            <p slot="text">One day. Three stages. A festival built to empower, elevate, and expand impact.</p>
        </SectionHead>
        <ul
            class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,17rem),1fr))] gap-5 list-none"
            data-scroll
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            <li class="card card--subgrid">
                <span class="card__tag">Music</span>
                <h3>A Storytelling Music Production</h3>
                <p>Immersed in diverse realities of <em class="not-italic text-purple-bright">what it means to be a woman</em> &mdash; popular DJs, dancers, burlesque, live instrumentalists, choreographed flash mobs, LED + fire flow shows, comedians, ecstatic dance workshops, and spoken word poetry. Genres range from Pop to EDM.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card card--subgrid">
                <span class="card__tag card__tag--pink">Community</span>
                <h3>A Growing Movement</h3>
                <p>In cross-collaboration with collectives like EDM Prosperity Network, Warrior Women, Amplify EDM, and Baked Up &mdash; building space for Austin's community of leading creative organizations.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card card--subgrid">
                <span class="card__tag card__tag--cyan">Stories</span>
                <h3>A Live Podcast Session</h3>
                <p>To kickstart EmpowHER, inspiring panelists share their journeys on authenticity and resilience while being challenged with surrounding topics of ageism + sexism.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card card--subgrid">
                <span class="card__tag card__tag--yellow">Platform</span>
                <h3>A Platform for Authentic Awareness</h3>
                <p>Inviting sponsors and vendors who align with the mission to empower creatives and amplify genuine self-expression.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .home-pillars__her {
        color: var(--color-purple);
        text-shadow: 0 0 1.4em var(--color-purple-55);
    }
</style>
